{"id":"raven-man","name":"Raven Man","type":"character","aliases":["the raven","The Raven Man"],"description":"The fragment of Lim-Dûl's essence from the Ring of Mairsil, appearing as an older man with white hair and gold eyes who haunts and manipulates Liliana Vess.","pages":15,"first_seen":"2014-07-01","last_seen":"2018-03-22","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Lim-Dûl","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Lim-D%C3%BBl","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Lim-D%C3%BBl","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Lim-Dûl\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"veil-deceit-2014-07-01-e4","era":null,"summary":"Liliana's tattoos bleed as the Onakke voices fall silent, and she sees a vision of the Onakke city in which a purplish cloud obliterates the ogres.","participants":["liliana-vess","onakke","raven-man"],"location":"onakke-catacomb","importance":"major","page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":455,"story_date":"2014-07-01","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"A cascade of meteors streaked across the sky as the Onakke were utterly obliterated before her eyes.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=A%20cascade%20of%20meteors,obliterated%20before%20her%20eyes.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=A%20cascade%20of%20meteors,obliterated%20before%20her%20eyes.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}},{"id":"liliana-vess-e1","era