":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Lim-D%C3%BBl","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Lim-D%C3%BBl#:~:text=even%20saved%20her%20life,over%20the%20Chain%20Veil","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Lim-Dûl\", section \"Haunting Liliana Vess\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"lim-d-l-e17","era":{"date":"2015-07-17","era":"ori","label":"Magic Origins"},"summary":"With Ugin's help Liliana relieves herself of the Chain Veil, to the Raven Man's disappointment.","participants":["liliana-vess","ugin","raven-man","chain-veil"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"wiki/lim-d-l","order":2197,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":22,"quote":"He was utterly disappointed when Liliana, with the help of Ugin , managed to relieve herself of the Chain Veil .","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Lim-D%C3%BBl#:~:text=He%20was%20utterly%20disappointed,the%20Chain%20Veil%20.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Lim-Dûl","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Lim-D%C3%BBl","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Lim-D%C3%BBl#:~:text=He%20was%20utterly%20disappointed,the%20Chain%20Veil%20.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Lim-Dûl\", section \"Haunting Liliana Vess\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"unkindness-ravens-2015-07-29-e2","era":null,"summary":"Liliana is drawn into a courtyard of ravens and confronts the Raven Man.","participants":["liliana-vess","raven-man"],"location":"second-district","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unkindness-ravens-2015-07-29","order":507,"story_date":"2015-07-29","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":28,"quote":"the Raven Man stepped forward from their midst","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unkindness-ravens-2015-07-29#:~:text=the%2