"\"Liliana's Indignation\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 20 Apr 2016."}},{"id":"lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20-e7","era":null,"summary":"Liliana realizes Jace can see the Raven Man, and strikes the real Jace with a bolt of magic.","participants":["liliana-vess","jace-beleren","raven-man"],"location":"liliana-s-manor","importance":"minor","page":"stories/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20","order":548,"story_date":"2016-04-20","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":71,"quote":"She let loose a bolt of magic at Jace, the real Jace, that left him doubled over in pain.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20#:~:text=She%20let%20loose%20a,doubled%20over%20in%20pain.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Liliana's Indignation","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-04-20","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20#:~:text=She%20let%20loose%20a,doubled%20over%20in%20pain.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Liliana's Indignation\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 20 Apr 2016."}},{"id":"lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20-e9","era":null,"summary":"Liliana tells Jace she does not want to hurt him; the pounding stops and the Raven Man vanishes in disgust.","participants":["liliana-vess","jace-beleren","raven-man"],"location":"liliana-s-manor","importance":"major","page":"stories/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20","order":548,"story_date":"2016-04-20","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":90,"quote":"The Raven Man sighed in disgust and disappeared in a rustle of feathers.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20#:~:text=The%20Raven%20Man%20sighed,a%20rustle%20of%20feathers.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Liliana's Indignation","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-04-20","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20#:~:text=The%20Raven%20Man%20sighed,a%20rustle%20of%20feathers.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Liliana's Indignation\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 20 Apr 2016."}},{"id":"lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20-e18","era":null,"summary":"Liliana follows Gared up the tower stairs with the Chain Veil, while a raven watches and vanishes.","participants":["liliana-vess","gared","raven-man","chain-veil"],"location":"liliana-s-manor","importance":"minor","page":"stories/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20","order":548,"story_date":"2016-04-20","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":205,"quote":"Liliana walked upward, into darkness.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20#:~:text=Liliana%20walked%20upward%2C%20into%20darkness.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Liliana's Indignation","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-04-20","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lilianas-indignation-2016-04-20#:~:text=Liliana%20walked%20upward%2C%20into%20darkness.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Liliana's Indignation\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 20 Apr 2016."}},{"id":"liliana-vess-e19","era":{"date":"2016-07-01","era":"2016","label":"2016"},"summary":"Liliana stalks off after Jace goes with Gideon instead of helping her.","participants":["liliana-vess","jace-beleren","gideon-jura","raven-man"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/liliana-vess","order":2194,"story_date":"","storyline":"","